{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06332","headline":"家园夜坐寄郭微 · 祖咏","name":"家园夜坐寄郭微","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前堦微雨歇，开户散窥林。\n月出夜方浅，水凉池更深。\n余风生竹树，清露薄衣襟。\n遇物遂遥叹，怀人滋远心。\n依稀成梦想，影响绝徽音。\n谁念穷居者，明时嗟陆沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}